  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The position vector of the particle can be written as,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>The velocity of the particle will be,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Now the acceleration of the particle will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>t</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
